# Pulsar session logic (Expo / TypeScript)

- Derive visible phase from persisted timestamps plus `Date.now()`; never from notification delivery time.
- Run reconciliation when the app returns to `active` and after storage hydration.
- Treat `expo-notifications` as side effects only; cancellations must not define truth state.
- Do not auto-start the next focus session after a break completes; require explicit user action.
- During `focus_active`, leaving `AppState` `active` destabilizes the session per PRD.
- Keep domain math pure (no React) and cover edge cases with unit tests.
